            "id": "density-8-2",
            "source": "system",
            "text": "SQLite WAL mode does not work across a network filesystem, so our shared-NFS design cannot use WAL."
          },
          {
            "id": "density-8-3",
            "source": "system",
            "text": "Amazon S3 versioning preserves overwritten object versions, so we can use it for accidental-overwrite recovery."
          },
          {
            "id": "density-8-4",
            "source": "system",
            "text": "AWS Lambda functions have a maximum execution timeout of 15 minutes, so the 20-minute export job needs a different runtime."
          },
          {
            "id": "density-8-5",
            "source": "system",
