          },
          {
            "id": "density-8-8",
            "source": "system",
            "text": "Redis supports setting a TTL on individual keys, so it can expire each temporary session record automatically."
          },
          {
            "id": "density-8-9",
            "source": "system",
            "text": "Correction to the PostgreSQL statement: I mean version 16, not version 15. PostgreSQL 16 supports row-level security; our tenant isolation choice depends on that."
          },
